WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.200
EPISODE 20

01:39.800 --> 01:42.560
Cousin, what did you say? Say it again.

01:42.640 --> 01:44.760
Ah Cai was once a maid in the Li family.

01:44.840 --> 01:47.400
When Mr. Li fell ill,
he sent his servants away.

01:47.480 --> 01:48.440
She then left the house

01:48.520 --> 01:50.320
and married a butcher.

01:50.400 --> 01:54.840
They had a son, Youlong, now 16.

01:55.560 --> 01:56.760
Sixteen?

01:57.560 --> 01:59.000
He's a posthumous child?

01:59.080 --> 02:01.320
Mother-in-law is so tough.
Father-in-law still had affairs?

02:01.400 --> 02:03.280
Stop talking nonsense.

02:03.360 --> 02:04.880
She said there's no such thing.

02:06.720 --> 02:08.400
Who can say for sure?

02:08.480 --> 02:10.520
Now, a lively young man shows up.

02:10.600 --> 02:11.680
He can even accuse them.

02:11.760 --> 02:13.080
It's gone to court now.

02:13.800 --> 02:14.880
Chai.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.360
Yuanming, how's it going?

02:19.680 --> 02:21.360
Lord Shen accepted the case?

02:22.680 --> 02:23.640
Not only that,

02:24.200 --> 02:25.840
their relatives also reported it

02:25.920 --> 02:26.920
to the Kaifeng Court.

02:27.000 --> 02:28.280
What?

02:28.360 --> 02:31.320
The Li family now has two cases
against them.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.440
What did Shen Huizhao say?

02:32.520 --> 02:36.000
I asked his teacher, Minister Liu,
for a letter

02:36.080 --> 02:40.080
and delivered my request
to his house in person,

02:40.160 --> 02:41.360
but he refused to meet.

02:42.320 --> 02:44.360
Not even a polite excuse.

02:44.440 --> 02:45.760
Never seen someone so stubborn.

02:46.680 --> 02:49.200
No wonder people call him Iron Heart.

02:49.800 --> 02:51.360
He's totally heartless.

02:53.360 --> 02:54.840
- Oh no.
- What's wrong?

02:55.440 --> 02:56.880
They're after Li's property.

02:56.960 --> 02:58.440
If they want to go to the court,

02:58.520 --> 03:00.280
Li's daughters will appear in court.

03:01.640 --> 03:03.200
Why didn't I think of this? This is bad.

03:05.360 --> 03:08.080
Mom, drink the medicine first.

03:09.720 --> 03:11.000
- Just a sip.
- Mom.

03:11.080 --> 03:12.040
I don't want to.

03:13.720 --> 03:15.040
What are you looking for?

03:15.120 --> 03:17.720
I'm checking if Dad left behind any notes

03:17.800 --> 03:19.480
to verify the identity of them.

03:21.320 --> 03:23.160
You heartless child.

03:23.240 --> 03:25.400
You're my daughter.

03:26.080 --> 03:27.560
You still believe those two liars?

03:28.160 --> 03:29.680
If you speak something like that again,

03:30.280 --> 03:33.720
your father's spirit won't forgive you.

03:35.400 --> 03:36.440
Mom.

03:37.240 --> 03:38.360
Say sorry to Mom.

03:39.200 --> 03:40.320
Okay?

03:41.560 --> 03:43.720
Mom, ask Shouhua,

03:43.800 --> 03:44.760
Kangning,

03:44.840 --> 03:46.320
who doesn't think like this?

03:46.400 --> 03:48.520
You can scold or beat me.

03:49.160 --> 03:50.920
Others will just try to appease you.

03:51.720 --> 03:53.040
In this family, besides me,

03:53.640 --> 03:55.160
who dares speak the truth?

03:57.120 --> 03:58.160
Haode.

04:01.760 --> 04:03.600
What are you doing here?
What about Jiaojiao?

04:04.360 --> 04:05.400
She's with her grandma.

04:05.480 --> 04:06.840
Mom, this is serious.

04:06.920 --> 04:08.640
When did Dad have another son?

04:11.680 --> 04:12.720
You think so too?

04:20.360 --> 04:22.160
You all think so too?

04:22.240 --> 04:23.560
All of you?

04:23.640 --> 04:24.960
Mom,

04:25.040 --> 04:27.080
we trust Dad,

04:28.160 --> 04:30.400
but we need to clarify things.

04:30.480 --> 04:32.400
We can't blindly go into this lawsuit.

04:33.160 --> 04:34.120
Right?

04:34.880 --> 04:38.520
He was under my nose this whole time.

04:39.080 --> 04:44.440
When did they stir up such trouble?

04:44.520 --> 04:46.400
How could they hide it from me?

04:47.080 --> 04:49.800
Now, you all come asking me questions?

04:49.880 --> 04:52.080
The coffin's already rotting.

04:52.160 --> 04:54.760
How can I dig up the truth now?

04:55.400 --> 04:57.160
Posthumous child?

04:57.240 --> 04:59.400
They only appeared after 16 years.

04:59.480 --> 05:02.760
They are taking advantage that Dad's gone,
so they can tell lies as they wish.

05:03.840 --> 05:06.440
But Dad's gone now.

05:06.520 --> 05:09.320
We can't prove he's not his father.

05:19.120 --> 05:19.960
Mom.

05:20.680 --> 05:23.000
Those people are thieves,
robbing our land and property.

05:23.600 --> 05:25.240
The little that's left,

05:25.320 --> 05:27.280
we risked our lives to protect.

05:28.040 --> 05:29.680
I'm a Li family daughter.

05:30.640 --> 05:32.080
I'll go to court with you.

05:32.880 --> 05:35.400
No one outside will take what's ours.

05:36.160 --> 05:38.640
If we have to face the punishment,

05:38.720 --> 05:40.040
I'll take it for Mom.

05:43.960 --> 05:45.160
Haode.

05:49.280 --> 05:51.640
Leshan, go.

05:51.720 --> 05:53.880
Bring your brothers-in-law back.

05:53.960 --> 05:56.480
It's rare for Haode to have such courage.

05:56.560 --> 05:58.680
We will surely go.

05:58.760 --> 06:00.720
But what will we say in court?

06:00.800 --> 06:02.480
We need to discuss that.

06:03.240 --> 06:04.520
We're going to court.

06:04.600 --> 06:06.360
The law of the Song Dynasty is there.

06:06.440 --> 06:09.120
They can't just make things up
and get away with it.

06:09.200 --> 06:11.600
Alright, we'll do it your way.

06:13.200 --> 06:15.080
- Go, Leshan.
- Okay.

06:21.920 --> 06:23.840
KAIFENG COURT

06:23.920 --> 06:29.520
Order.

06:35.160 --> 06:36.240
Li family brothers,

06:36.320 --> 06:38.360
why are you suing your Aunt Li?

06:38.440 --> 06:39.440
My lord,

06:41.080 --> 06:45.320
since Uncle passed
and Cousin Shifan tragically died,

06:46.400 --> 06:49.920
the clan head decided we need a successor

06:50.440 --> 06:52.000
to inherit his legacy.

06:52.080 --> 06:54.600
But Aunt refused to adopt one.

06:54.680 --> 06:56.160
This wicked woman

06:56.240 --> 06:59.240
is trying to cut off
my uncle's descendant.

06:59.320 --> 07:01.880
Ridiculous.

07:01.960 --> 07:05.880
If a man dies,
the wife has the right to judge.

07:05.960 --> 07:08.040
Since Mr. Li and his son are gone

07:08.120 --> 07:09.920
and Madam Li hasn't remarried,

07:10.000 --> 07:13.240
his inheritance should go
to his daughters.

07:13.320 --> 07:15.320
Who dares take it from them?

07:16.160 --> 07:17.240
Did you hear that?

07:18.160 --> 07:19.360
It's for the daughters.

07:19.440 --> 07:21.160
Two of my five daughters aren't married.

07:21.240 --> 07:23.440
We wouldn't dare, my lord. You're right.

07:24.640 --> 07:29.400
But my uncle left a will

07:29.480 --> 07:31.520
to let Aunt support us

07:31.600 --> 07:36.880
80 strings per year
and 200 catty of grain.

07:37.480 --> 07:40.200
But over the past ten years,
Aunt's never mentioned anything about it.

07:40.280 --> 07:43.280
We've had no choice but to sue.

07:44.160 --> 07:45.720
My lord, we have the document,

07:45.800 --> 07:49.560
signed by the clan head and all relatives.

07:49.640 --> 07:53.120
My lord, Aunt even sold land

07:53.200 --> 07:56.040
and moved the family
just to avoid the promise.

07:56.120 --> 07:58.800
We ask you to rule on this.

07:58.880 --> 08:01.160
Please, my lord.

08:02.200 --> 08:04.440
You still dare to ask for debts from me?

08:04.520 --> 08:06.360
- My lord.
- The wheat you stole from my land.

08:06.440 --> 08:08.960
How much did you sell it for?
How much did you sell from my land?

08:09.040 --> 08:09.920
Tell me.

08:10.000 --> 08:11.840
- What're you doing?
- What'd you get for the silverware

08:11.920 --> 08:13.640
- at your uncles mourning hall?
- Help, my lord.

08:13.720 --> 08:15.640
- How much did you get from his funeral?
- My lord.

08:15.720 --> 08:17.040
- Why don't you say that?
- My lord.

08:17.120 --> 08:18.760
- Not enough for your coffin?
- Mom!

08:18.840 --> 08:20.160
- Order!
- Ah!

08:23.560 --> 08:25.360
My lord, you saw it all.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.920
She's hitting me in court.

08:28.600 --> 08:30.240
We're family.

08:30.320 --> 08:32.440
We didn't want to go to court,

08:32.520 --> 08:37.520
but Aunt treats us like enemies.

08:38.360 --> 08:42.480
We're here today
because we have no choice.

08:42.560 --> 08:44.800
We ask you to give us justice.

08:44.880 --> 08:46.440
We ask you to give us justice.

08:46.520 --> 08:47.760
Worse than pigs and dogs.

08:49.240 --> 08:50.440
Shouting in court.

08:50.520 --> 08:53.280
Slap 20 times. Guards!

08:53.360 --> 08:55.520
My lord, my cousin's causing a scene,

08:55.600 --> 08:56.600
making false accusations.

08:56.680 --> 08:58.600
My mother was overwhelmed by anger.

08:59.280 --> 09:00.600
Please show mercy

09:00.680 --> 09:02.360
and spare her because of her weak body.

09:02.440 --> 09:05.240
If she does this again,

09:05.320 --> 09:07.800
I'll take her place.

09:08.400 --> 09:09.920
In court,

09:10.000 --> 09:11.440
if anyone dares act up again,

09:11.520 --> 09:12.960
add 20 more lashes.

09:16.200 --> 09:17.800
- Li Shiqian.
- My lord.

09:17.880 --> 09:19.680
You said

09:19.760 --> 09:22.000
you want to bring the outside child
into the family.

09:22.080 --> 09:25.760
Now, I'm combining both cases
into one case.

09:25.840 --> 09:27.760
Any objections from either side?

09:28.840 --> 09:31.600
Let the court decide.

09:31.680 --> 09:34.720
Take the plaintiff, Ah Cai and Li Youlong.

09:39.600 --> 09:41.640
- My lord.
- My lord.

09:41.720 --> 09:45.120
I have a warning about a posthumous child.

09:45.200 --> 09:47.320
There's no proof left
because his dad's gone.

09:47.400 --> 09:48.400
I won't accept the case.

09:49.000 --> 09:50.320
If you can't provide any proof

09:50.400 --> 09:52.240
to demonstrate your lineage,

09:52.320 --> 09:54.200
I'll treat it as a fraud case.

09:54.280 --> 09:55.560
You'll be punished in the end.

09:55.640 --> 09:57.880
My lord, I would never.

09:57.960 --> 09:59.760
About the origin of Ah Cai's son.

09:59.840 --> 10:02.560
Before my uncle passed, he often sighed.

10:02.640 --> 10:06.120
He feared my aunt's jealousy
would harm his son.

10:06.200 --> 10:07.320
He never revealed the truth.

10:07.400 --> 10:11.320
Before he died, he couldn't
bring Youlong back to the family.

10:11.400 --> 10:12.920
This became his lifelong regret.

10:13.520 --> 10:17.040
They live in hardship now,
struggling to survive.

10:17.120 --> 10:19.240
As his cousin,

10:19.320 --> 10:21.200
I must seek justice for him

10:21.280 --> 10:22.320
and help my poor kin

10:22.400 --> 10:24.400
to finish my uncle's last wish

10:24.480 --> 10:25.520
and let him rest in peace.

10:26.120 --> 10:27.720
You--

10:27.800 --> 10:28.760
Mom.

10:32.880 --> 10:35.000
My lord, my mother's fuming,

10:35.080 --> 10:36.440
so she's kind of acted out.

10:36.520 --> 10:38.200
Please let me respond for her.

10:40.160 --> 10:41.320
Okay.

10:46.960 --> 10:48.160
Shouhua.

10:49.080 --> 10:51.360
You just need to know the marriage law.

10:52.080 --> 10:53.320
I've pointed out the section.

11:00.440 --> 11:03.320
Maybe let bother-in-law
accompany Mom in court.

11:04.240 --> 11:06.680
The judge might consider his reputation.

11:07.320 --> 11:10.080
And Kangning, you have a silver tongue.

11:10.160 --> 11:12.080
Your words are more convincing.

11:12.160 --> 11:13.920
Your big sisters are all married,

11:14.000 --> 11:15.880
and we can't even get involved.

11:15.960 --> 11:18.760
Many things should be said by you,
the unmarried daughter.

11:20.120 --> 11:21.960
Haode, these sections are fixed.

11:22.040 --> 11:24.200
You should argue
based on the rules in court.

11:24.280 --> 11:25.440
We're counting on you.

11:26.040 --> 11:30.320
Remember,
you're not just fighting for Mom.

11:30.400 --> 11:32.640
You're fighting for yourself and Leshan.

11:33.360 --> 11:34.400
Li Haode.

11:37.760 --> 11:40.040
Li Haode, do you have a defense?

11:40.680 --> 11:41.640
My lord.

11:41.720 --> 11:43.680
They've been after our estate for years,

11:43.760 --> 11:47.240
and they have even sued us over and over.

11:47.320 --> 11:49.440
They're sworn enemies.

11:49.520 --> 11:50.480
You can't trust them.

11:50.560 --> 11:52.080
This is a sacred court.

11:52.160 --> 11:54.640
A girl shouldn't be speaking here.
Leave now.

11:54.720 --> 11:56.000
Leave.

11:56.080 --> 11:58.560
I'm the unmarried daughter of the Li.

11:58.640 --> 12:00.080
The estate should belong to us.

12:00.920 --> 12:02.880
They are accusing their aunt unfairly.

12:03.480 --> 12:07.320
They've disrespected elders
and now questioning me?

12:07.400 --> 12:08.640
This doesn't make any sense.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.640
You…

12:12.120 --> 12:14.400
She's right.

12:15.400 --> 12:17.840
Ah Cai, any other proof?

12:18.520 --> 12:19.440
My lord,

12:21.240 --> 12:23.800
in the fifth month of the fifth year
of Dazhong Xiangfu,

12:24.520 --> 12:26.600
I left pregnant.

12:27.200 --> 12:28.640
Mr. Li passed in the sixth month.

12:29.680 --> 12:32.200
Youlong was born on the 15th
of the second month in the next year.

12:33.080 --> 12:35.000
Granny Liu from Bozi Street

12:35.080 --> 12:37.360
and Li Auntie can testify.

12:37.440 --> 12:39.560
Before coming to Bianjing,

12:39.640 --> 12:42.520
they stamped this paper.

12:46.800 --> 12:49.440
The midwife only knew he was premature.

12:50.040 --> 12:53.280
How could she know if he's Li or Wu?

12:53.360 --> 12:56.960
You're all conspiring together
to blackmail us.

12:58.560 --> 13:00.960
- Mom.
- The Li couple only had one son.

13:01.040 --> 13:03.240
The Li family is not so rich

13:03.320 --> 13:05.760
but still values education.

13:05.840 --> 13:08.920
How could he let his kid follow a butcher?

13:09.000 --> 13:10.560
His wife, though jealous,

13:10.640 --> 13:13.640
seeing the family fall apart,

13:13.720 --> 13:16.440
she'd rather bear the pressure
from the family

13:16.520 --> 13:19.920
than take in the orphan
to keep life moving forward.

13:20.800 --> 13:21.800
This doesn't make sense.

13:22.400 --> 13:24.240
My lord.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.640
Don't listen to her.

13:26.240 --> 13:28.280
She didn't even honor my uncle's will.

13:28.360 --> 13:31.560
She's not like other virtuous women.

13:31.640 --> 13:33.000
My lord,

13:33.080 --> 13:36.360
before my father passed,
he gave his cousin some property.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.800
It was out of necessity.

13:38.320 --> 13:40.400
Haven't you heard of the three-way split?

13:41.000 --> 13:42.520
The wise minister Zhang Guaiya.

13:42.600 --> 13:44.400
He once judged a case of inheritance.

13:45.560 --> 13:48.480
When someone passed,
the son-in-law got seven.

13:48.560 --> 13:49.680
The son only got three.

13:49.760 --> 13:52.440
When the son grew up, they fought over it.

13:53.040 --> 13:54.480
Zhang knew the father's intention.

13:55.200 --> 13:57.800
The son was three when his father died.

13:57.880 --> 14:00.480
His father feared the son would be harmed.

14:00.560 --> 14:02.440
So, he left a will out of desperation.

14:02.520 --> 14:04.640
In the end, Zhang changed the judgment.

14:05.360 --> 14:08.120
The son got seven, the son-in-law three.

14:09.920 --> 14:11.360
Son was young, son-in-law strong.

14:11.440 --> 14:12.760
So, the son-in-law got seven.

14:12.840 --> 14:14.720
My father was poor, but his cousin rich.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.120
My father couldn't be at ease.

14:16.760 --> 14:18.560
Before he died,

14:18.640 --> 14:19.720
he begged the cousins,

14:19.800 --> 14:24.960
asking his cousins to treat us kindly.

14:25.640 --> 14:26.800
Don't you remember?

14:26.880 --> 14:31.240
My family's stolen grain
weighed over a thousand.

14:31.320 --> 14:34.400
You greedy thieves still dare to steal?

14:37.720 --> 14:42.240
As for Wu Youlong,
he is definitely not my father's son.

14:42.320 --> 14:45.080
My father was kind to the poor,
loved talent.

14:45.640 --> 14:47.280
Liu Wang is the son of the tenant.

14:47.360 --> 14:49.640
He came to our house seeking
financial help for his studies.

14:49.720 --> 14:51.320
My father helped him with his education.

14:51.960 --> 14:54.640
Before his death,
he left a will for his nephews.

14:54.720 --> 14:56.640
He even gave half his old books to Liu.

14:57.280 --> 14:59.400
But he didn't leave anything
to his own son?

14:59.480 --> 15:01.240
This is truly weird.

15:01.760 --> 15:03.520
After Ah Cai gave birth,

15:03.600 --> 15:05.960
she did not return her son to the family.

15:06.040 --> 15:08.880
My father and my brother passed away.

15:08.960 --> 15:10.640
They never came to mourn.

15:10.720 --> 15:12.440
The county clerk's register shows,

15:12.520 --> 15:14.400
in the third month this year,
butcher Wu Yong died.

15:14.480 --> 15:16.800
They changed their surname from Wu to Li.

15:16.880 --> 15:19.840
Their intentions are clear to everyone.

15:26.040 --> 15:27.440
A letter from a Luoyang,

15:27.520 --> 15:29.280
they only changed their surname in March.

15:29.960 --> 15:31.920
We were staying under someone else's roof.

15:32.760 --> 15:36.000
How could he change his name
before the stepfather died?

15:36.080 --> 15:39.200
Young lady, this doesn't make sense.

15:42.120 --> 15:44.240
- Nonsense.
- Don't you dare!

15:46.800 --> 15:47.640
Okay.

15:48.640 --> 15:49.640
It's the ironclad proof.

15:50.280 --> 15:53.080
In our family,
fathers have a bent little finger.

15:53.160 --> 15:55.160
It can't straighten,
and it passed down to sons.

15:55.240 --> 15:57.200
- What?
- I don't know.

15:57.280 --> 15:58.760
Really?

15:59.320 --> 16:00.400
You know that?

16:00.480 --> 16:02.040
Never heard of it.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.120
Before that…

16:04.640 --> 16:07.800
My lord, though Wu Yong had a vile trade,

16:07.880 --> 16:09.160
he did give life to him.

16:09.840 --> 16:11.720
Wu Youlong, as a son,

16:11.800 --> 16:15.560
in order to steal inheritance,
he changed his surname from Wu to Li.

16:15.640 --> 16:18.280
Such greed and ungratefulness

16:18.360 --> 16:20.440
mustn't have tricked you, my lord.

16:20.520 --> 16:22.320
Justice always prevails.

16:23.360 --> 16:26.200
They're lying, my lord. It's all a lie.

16:27.040 --> 16:29.000
Li Haode's words are clear and logical.

16:29.600 --> 16:33.160
If you still don't confess,
I'll have to apply torture.

16:38.720 --> 16:39.960
Pressing sticks.

16:44.760 --> 16:45.800
My lord.

16:49.880 --> 16:52.880
It was him. He came to us.

16:52.960 --> 16:55.480
He urged us to change the surname.

16:55.560 --> 16:57.440
I was just confused.

16:57.520 --> 16:58.720
Please show mercy, my lord.

16:58.800 --> 17:00.280
- Please show mercy.
- Please show mercy.

17:00.360 --> 17:01.960
- My lord, they're the greedy ones.
- My lord.

17:02.040 --> 17:03.240
We didn't know anything.

17:03.320 --> 17:05.520
My lord, we acted in good faith.

17:05.600 --> 17:07.280
We were just witnesses. Forgive us.

17:07.360 --> 17:08.800
- My lord, we were deceived.
- My lord.

17:08.880 --> 17:10.320
- Please, my lord.
- My lord.

17:10.400 --> 17:11.280
Show mercy to us.

17:11.360 --> 17:12.720
- My lord. We didn't know.
- My lord.

17:14.440 --> 17:15.440
Enough!

17:17.320 --> 17:19.280
Ah Cai and Wu Youlong conspired

17:19.360 --> 17:23.600
with Li family's four nephews
to lie about their lineage.

17:23.680 --> 17:26.440
Since this is their first offense,
they will be beaten 80 times

17:26.520 --> 17:27.600
as punishment.

17:27.680 --> 17:30.000
Li Shida, Li Shiqian,

17:30.080 --> 17:32.320
Li Shide, Li Shiye.

17:32.400 --> 17:34.640
You forgot the kindness of your uncle

17:34.720 --> 17:36.400
and plotted for inheritance.

17:37.080 --> 17:39.360
Bullying the orphaned,
destroying family morals.

17:39.440 --> 17:42.280
Years of disputes, no repentance.

17:42.880 --> 17:44.080
Each will get 100 lashes

17:44.160 --> 17:45.680
and within a month

17:45.760 --> 17:47.480
return the Li family's silver,

17:47.560 --> 17:49.000
boxes, and grain.

17:49.080 --> 17:50.720
From now on, you should never bother them.

17:50.800 --> 17:54.280
If you sue again,
you will be exiled and severely punished.

17:54.360 --> 17:55.240
Adjourned.

18:20.640 --> 18:21.600
That must really hurt.

18:23.200 --> 18:25.320
Haode, how did I not know?

18:25.400 --> 18:27.880
Your father and brother's finger thing.

18:27.960 --> 18:31.480
Mom, how could there be
a disease like that?

18:31.560 --> 18:34.040
I saw he was not confessing,
so, I just tricked him.

18:35.120 --> 18:36.560
That's clever.

18:37.080 --> 18:38.240
I learned it from you, Mom.

18:39.640 --> 18:40.800
Let's go.

19:22.680 --> 19:24.280
This one's nice.

19:24.360 --> 19:27.080
This looks like something Shouhua wears.

19:27.160 --> 19:28.760
Why take it?

19:30.040 --> 19:32.120
I said her pin looks nice.

19:32.200 --> 19:34.040
She said she'd give me a better one

19:34.120 --> 19:35.600
if I win the case.

19:35.680 --> 19:37.200
Don't break it. Give it back.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.840
I like it too.

19:40.680 --> 19:41.720
Can I borrow it?

19:41.800 --> 19:45.800
No way. I'll need it for my wedding.

19:47.600 --> 19:48.600
You…

19:48.680 --> 19:49.640
Haode,

19:49.720 --> 19:51.640
you haven't even seen a matchmaker yet

19:51.720 --> 19:54.080
and you're daydreaming. How shameless.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.560
Let me try.

19:55.640 --> 19:57.920
What are you saying? Give it back to me.

19:58.000 --> 19:59.320
- Shouhua gave it to me.
- Give it.

19:59.400 --> 20:00.720
- I--
- That's from--

20:03.160 --> 20:04.840
Let me check it.

20:07.040 --> 20:08.520
Why are you like this?

20:08.600 --> 20:10.280
You take whatever looks good.

20:10.360 --> 20:11.960
You've ruined my gift.

20:13.520 --> 20:15.120
Why are you two arguing?

20:15.200 --> 20:16.880
You even fell down.

20:16.960 --> 20:18.120
What's so special?

20:18.200 --> 20:19.760
Just have her buy it for you.

20:19.840 --> 20:20.760
All you do is argue.

20:20.840 --> 20:23.320
It's giving me a headache.

20:25.280 --> 20:26.800
You have five daughters,

20:27.560 --> 20:29.160
but only I was picked by the river.

20:30.160 --> 20:32.480
What nonsense are you talking?

20:33.320 --> 20:35.200
Why is it that among your five fingers,

20:35.760 --> 20:38.000
I'm always the shortest one?

20:38.080 --> 20:39.400
You always favor her.

20:40.600 --> 20:41.440
You're so biased.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.600
- Where are you going?
- Haode.

20:46.200 --> 20:47.560
Are you really angry?

20:48.720 --> 20:50.280
Cut me some slack, okay?

20:50.360 --> 20:52.480
Hurry, go after her.

20:52.560 --> 20:53.400
I--

20:54.920 --> 20:56.640
Mom, trust me.

20:56.720 --> 20:57.840
She will be back soon.

20:58.480 --> 21:00.080
Tonight, we'll have lamb.

21:00.160 --> 21:02.920
Lamb is her favorite.

21:03.000 --> 21:05.040
Trust me, she'll be back.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.760
Alright.

21:06.840 --> 21:09.160
You're not allowed to eat,
you little foodie.

21:15.480 --> 21:16.360
Come here.

21:17.800 --> 21:18.880
Shouhua.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.040
My lady,

21:26.120 --> 21:28.280
I thought I'd never see you again.

21:29.680 --> 21:31.160
Mom insisted on going home,

21:31.800 --> 21:32.760
so I sent her back.

21:32.840 --> 21:34.720
On the way back, I met her.

21:35.880 --> 21:37.480
The Yu family sold servant girls.

21:37.560 --> 21:39.920
A passing merchant bought her.

21:40.000 --> 21:41.880
They'd already signed a deal.

21:41.960 --> 21:43.960
I still managed to buy her back.

21:44.640 --> 21:47.200
Shouhua, didn't you always care about her?

21:48.360 --> 21:52.080
Sangma, take her to settle.

21:52.160 --> 21:53.040
Sure.

22:02.680 --> 22:03.520
Shouhua.

22:04.120 --> 22:07.200
I worked hard to buy her back.

22:07.960 --> 22:10.440
How should I be rewarded?

22:12.080 --> 22:16.040
Aren't you busy moving to the new house?

22:16.120 --> 22:18.560
You even have time
for small matters like this?

22:18.640 --> 22:20.480
You can't bear to leave your mom,

22:20.560 --> 22:22.600
living in this house,

22:23.440 --> 22:25.320
so I decided not to move.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.320
We're married here.

22:27.920 --> 22:31.080
We'll live here, have children,
and grow old here together.

22:34.320 --> 22:36.680
Here's the deed to the land. Keep it.

22:36.760 --> 22:39.520
LAND DEED

22:44.200 --> 22:45.760
Shouhua.

22:48.280 --> 22:51.520
Shouhua, Leshan bullied me.

22:51.600 --> 22:53.720
She bullied me.

22:54.520 --> 22:56.120
You're fighting with her again?

22:56.880 --> 22:58.640
Come, come. Sit down.

22:58.720 --> 22:59.640
Come here.

22:59.720 --> 23:01.360
What happened? Tell me.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.200
Shouhua,

23:03.280 --> 23:05.440
she always mocks me for being dumb.

23:05.520 --> 23:07.440
She says

23:08.520 --> 23:11.080
I'll die alone at home.

23:14.680 --> 23:15.640
How could that be?

23:15.720 --> 23:19.400
You're so honest and cute.

23:20.000 --> 23:22.600
In the future, I'll ask Du
to find someone good

23:22.680 --> 23:24.240
among his colleagues for you, alright?

23:24.320 --> 23:25.680
Sure.

23:25.760 --> 23:28.960
I will help you find someone.

23:29.040 --> 23:31.640
Families with strict rules

23:32.440 --> 23:34.640
aren't as good as finding a rich,

23:34.720 --> 23:37.600
talented, and handsome man.

23:37.680 --> 23:40.480
I already have someone in mind.

23:40.560 --> 23:42.960
I hope you can help me

23:43.560 --> 23:46.280
to get to know him.

23:46.360 --> 23:50.080
Haode, marriage is serious, no jokes.

23:51.200 --> 23:52.720
We're family. Let her say.

23:53.760 --> 23:54.840
You have someone in mind.

23:54.920 --> 23:58.160
I must help you.

23:58.240 --> 24:00.000
So, who is he?

24:01.240 --> 24:04.200
It's the man who saved our family,

24:04.280 --> 24:06.200
the Kaifeng Court official,

24:06.280 --> 24:07.520
Mr. Shen. Shen Huizhao.

24:08.200 --> 24:11.360
I liked him the moment I saw him.

24:16.400 --> 24:18.000
SHEN MANSION

24:22.400 --> 24:23.600
Father,

24:23.680 --> 24:25.120
how's Granny's condition today?

24:25.200 --> 24:26.040
Has Dr. Lin arrived?

24:26.120 --> 24:27.160
You little brat…

24:27.240 --> 24:28.520
SHEN RONG, FATHER OF SHEN HUIZHAO

24:28.600 --> 24:29.760
…how dare you show up?

24:30.360 --> 24:34.120
Grandma's illness is because of you.

24:34.200 --> 24:36.960
A man at your age from a family like ours

24:37.040 --> 24:40.080
should already have a wife and kids,

24:40.680 --> 24:42.800
but you've wasted your time.

24:42.880 --> 24:44.880
You're the only one in Bianjing like this.

24:47.200 --> 24:48.640
Over the years,

24:49.200 --> 24:51.160
Grandma's tried to find a suitable match.

24:51.240 --> 24:54.920
All noble girls, talented and beautiful.

24:55.000 --> 24:56.240
Each is a good match.

24:56.320 --> 24:59.640
But you rejected them all.

25:00.360 --> 25:03.640
Other families now
are afraid of tying up with us.

25:04.240 --> 25:07.600
I heard that you even rejected Li Shiba.

25:07.680 --> 25:09.680
That's why Grandma got sick.

25:10.600 --> 25:11.600
If you

25:12.680 --> 25:14.120
have any conscience,

25:14.800 --> 25:16.200
marry someone soon.

25:16.880 --> 25:18.280
We don't care about status.

25:18.360 --> 25:20.040
Just marry someone decent.

25:20.120 --> 25:23.680
Take her to Grandma and offer respect.

25:24.400 --> 25:26.320
She'll be better by tomorrow.

25:26.400 --> 25:28.000
We won't need Dr. Lin.

25:30.320 --> 25:33.320
Father, I've said it a thousand times.

25:33.400 --> 25:35.360
I won't marry.

25:35.440 --> 25:37.960
After all these years, I'm still firm.

25:38.040 --> 25:39.320
Please understand.

25:40.120 --> 25:43.200
I'll go meet His Majesty
and request the palace doctors.

25:43.280 --> 25:45.480
I'll take my leave.

25:50.040 --> 25:51.440
Not marrying, not marrying.

25:52.120 --> 25:53.960
Are all women tigers?

25:54.040 --> 25:55.160
Will they eat you?

26:15.320 --> 26:16.920
- Did he leave?
- Yeah.

26:17.000 --> 26:18.040
Did he agree?

26:20.200 --> 26:22.480
It's all your fault.

26:22.560 --> 26:25.800
When he was little,
you sent him to the temple.

26:25.880 --> 26:27.280
What place is that?

26:27.880 --> 26:31.240
Everyone always meditates
and tries to understand Zen.

26:31.320 --> 26:34.520
That's where he became so detached.

26:35.160 --> 26:36.840
It's too late.

26:36.920 --> 26:38.080
Mom.

26:38.680 --> 26:40.960
How is this my fault?

26:41.040 --> 26:42.720
Didn't you say

26:42.800 --> 26:44.520
that since his two elder brothers
didn't live

26:44.600 --> 26:46.000
and he was weak then,

26:46.080 --> 26:50.320
he should go to the temple
to live peacefully?

26:51.160 --> 26:54.080
You said it was for his sickness
but not detachment.

26:54.160 --> 26:55.640
Who knew it'd turn out this way?

26:56.840 --> 26:58.600
It's also his job in law enforcement.

26:59.200 --> 27:00.880
Money and women have always caused harm.

27:00.960 --> 27:03.680
Women he saw were never kind.

27:03.760 --> 27:07.320
Over time, he treated women like a threat.

27:07.400 --> 27:09.280
What should we do?

27:15.160 --> 27:16.440
Don't worry.

27:20.160 --> 27:22.280
Madam. Master.

27:22.360 --> 27:24.960
Everyone's here to check on you.

27:26.600 --> 27:29.760
Also, there's a matchmaker visiting.

27:31.520 --> 27:34.480
Look at him, acting all pure and innocent.

27:36.400 --> 27:39.400
Like being with a woman
will shorten his life.

27:40.520 --> 27:43.120
Isn't he going to cancel the marriage?

27:43.200 --> 27:44.800
I'll marry for him.

27:45.440 --> 27:47.120
When the bride enters,

27:47.200 --> 27:49.880
let's see how he backs out.

27:50.720 --> 27:51.720
You mean?

27:51.800 --> 27:53.160
Proceed without telling him.

27:53.240 --> 27:56.440
He stays at the government office often.

27:57.240 --> 28:00.560
Let's say we're celebrating my birthday.

28:01.280 --> 28:03.600
Let's renovate the hall garden.

28:03.680 --> 28:06.640
We'll secretly plan the wedding.

28:09.000 --> 28:11.160
But who'd do such thing?

28:11.240 --> 28:14.520
If it's a family of equal status,
who would compromise?

28:15.160 --> 28:18.320
I fear we'll end up at odds
because of his stubbornness.

28:18.400 --> 28:19.560
- Not a good idea.
- Wait.

28:20.600 --> 28:23.920
Did a matchmaker come?

28:24.560 --> 28:25.800
Which family?

28:25.880 --> 28:27.400
Nonsense.

28:27.480 --> 28:30.360
Marriage is for the parents to decide.

28:30.440 --> 28:33.440
Ask the matchmaker, check the birthdates.

28:33.520 --> 28:36.240
There's no room for self-decision.

28:36.840 --> 28:40.480
If I speak the truth,
will you agree to it?

28:41.160 --> 28:42.360
How embarrassing.

28:42.440 --> 28:45.920
The Shen family
is not someone we can afford.

28:46.720 --> 28:50.920
It's fine if you're just
daydreaming about it yourself,

28:51.000 --> 28:55.360
but if we really
let a matchmaker go to their house,

28:55.440 --> 28:58.120
you'll make us the laughingstock.

28:58.200 --> 28:59.280
Mom.

28:59.360 --> 29:01.200
The matchmaker
will come with an answer today.

29:01.280 --> 29:03.200
If it works out, it's a good thing.

29:03.800 --> 29:06.800
If not, she can move on.

29:07.600 --> 29:09.800
Where's the luck like this?

29:09.880 --> 29:12.920
I've seen ice chunks
in the last month of the year

29:13.000 --> 29:16.000
but never heaven dropping gold.

29:16.080 --> 29:17.440
Mom.

29:17.520 --> 29:19.000
I'm your own daughter.

29:19.080 --> 29:21.040
Yes, you are my daughter.

29:21.120 --> 29:25.080
That's why I told you to give up
and stay grounded.

29:25.160 --> 29:26.840
It's for your own good, alright?

29:29.280 --> 29:32.840
Mom, the matchmaker is here.

29:32.920 --> 29:34.480
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

29:34.560 --> 29:36.160
Madam Li, big news.

29:36.240 --> 29:38.000
It's done. It's done.

29:38.880 --> 29:40.160
What's done?

29:41.040 --> 29:42.600
Is it the marriage?

29:43.240 --> 29:44.280
Yes,

29:44.360 --> 29:46.920
it's the marriage
between the Li and Shen families.

29:47.000 --> 29:49.360
About this marriage.

29:49.440 --> 29:51.240
Even though we're supported by Mr. Du,

29:51.320 --> 29:52.560
we didn't dare speak soon.

29:53.200 --> 29:54.640
We'd test the waters first.

29:54.720 --> 29:58.240
But when he heard
it was the Li family of Pan Street,

29:58.320 --> 29:59.840
Mr. Du's sister-in-law,

29:59.920 --> 30:02.000
they praised it as a lucky match.

30:02.080 --> 30:05.440
They even brought a preliminary letter
and matched her birthdate.

30:05.520 --> 30:07.440
They agreed right away.

30:07.520 --> 30:09.000
No dowry was asked.

30:09.080 --> 30:11.960
Just that Lady Shen is getting worse.

30:12.040 --> 30:13.160
So, they want good luck.

30:13.240 --> 30:14.640
The ceremony will be simple.

30:14.720 --> 30:16.240
The wedding must happen quickly.

30:16.920 --> 30:22.920
Th-the Shen family, the one from Kaifeng?

30:23.760 --> 30:24.800
See,

30:24.880 --> 30:26.760
I brought the matchmaker's letter.

30:26.840 --> 30:27.920
How could it be fake?

30:29.360 --> 30:31.680
Mom, it really is true.

30:31.760 --> 30:33.080
Heaven really does drop gold.

30:48.400 --> 30:50.720
SECOND DAY OF THE SECOND MONTH

31:00.240 --> 31:03.200
SHEN MANSION

31:03.280 --> 31:04.320
Ridiculous.

31:05.120 --> 31:07.280
I was away for work just two days.

31:07.360 --> 31:09.880
You snuck the bridal sedan into our house?

31:10.400 --> 31:12.520
Treating marriage like child's play,

31:13.120 --> 31:14.800
breaking family rules and morals aside,

31:14.880 --> 31:16.880
you've ruined an innocent girl's life.

31:16.960 --> 31:17.840
Enough.

31:17.920 --> 31:20.120
How dare you speak against your elders?

31:20.200 --> 31:22.760
No heir means ending our family line.

31:22.840 --> 31:23.840
An un-filial act.

31:23.920 --> 31:26.440
Don't you know your duty as a child?

31:26.520 --> 31:29.040
Ignoring father's mistakes,

31:29.600 --> 31:32.680
blindly indulging you and causing harm.

31:32.760 --> 31:33.880
That is un-filial.

31:33.960 --> 31:35.360
Shut up.

31:35.440 --> 31:36.800
Enough.

31:36.880 --> 31:39.840
I made the decision for this marriage.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.480
You…

31:42.600 --> 31:44.760
Whether you go along

31:45.400 --> 31:47.400
or resist,

31:48.120 --> 31:52.080
the bride entered through our front door.

31:52.760 --> 31:55.080
She's in your room now,

31:55.160 --> 31:56.960
which makes her your wife.

31:57.560 --> 32:01.200
She's the daughter-in-law
of our Shen family.

32:02.000 --> 32:05.680
The Li girl is young

32:05.760 --> 32:08.200
and full of joy as she married in.

32:08.280 --> 32:10.880
Yet you don't want her

32:10.960 --> 32:13.480
and ruin her life out of spite.

32:13.560 --> 32:15.680
That's your own bad karma.

32:16.920 --> 32:18.440
Even your illness was a lie.

32:19.080 --> 32:23.040
Everyone else knew but me.

32:23.120 --> 32:24.760
Who lied to you?

32:25.440 --> 32:26.960
Your grandmother's illness is real.

32:27.760 --> 32:29.120
If you listen to her,

32:29.200 --> 32:31.880
she'll recover and live long.

32:31.960 --> 32:33.600
That's how you show your devotion.

32:35.400 --> 32:36.280
Fine.

32:37.960 --> 32:38.840
Well done.

32:40.640 --> 32:42.880
Such a bold decision.

32:42.960 --> 32:43.920
Really well done!

32:45.320 --> 32:46.200
Come back!

32:50.840 --> 32:51.680
Mom.

32:52.240 --> 32:55.240
Wasn't this too much for him?

32:55.840 --> 32:57.800
You claimed illness to avoid strangers,

32:57.880 --> 32:58.920
skipped the banquet,

32:59.000 --> 33:02.120
and hid it from the Li family.

33:02.200 --> 33:03.560
If this gets out…

33:04.720 --> 33:06.960
Quick, go check on him.

33:07.040 --> 33:09.480
Don't let him
cause any trouble in the wedding room.

33:09.560 --> 33:10.600
Yes.

33:17.200 --> 33:19.000
We canceled the banquet
due to madam's illness.

33:19.600 --> 33:21.720
Missing the ceremony's time

33:21.800 --> 33:23.920
would offend the Li family.

33:24.000 --> 33:24.840
Hurry things along.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.640
Get out.

33:35.880 --> 33:38.280
You haven't drunk the wedding wine.

33:38.360 --> 33:39.600
That's against tradition.

33:39.680 --> 33:41.320
Please drink with your bride.

33:41.400 --> 33:42.280
Get out!

33:44.160 --> 33:45.760
Let's go.

34:01.560 --> 34:02.440
Li Haode.

34:03.120 --> 34:04.080
I need to tell you.

34:05.600 --> 34:07.280
What is it, husband?

34:07.360 --> 34:08.600
I'm not your husband.

34:09.440 --> 34:10.840
Though the sedan came here,

34:10.920 --> 34:12.720
there was no proper ceremony.

34:12.800 --> 34:15.040
No couple tradition, no rituals,

34:15.120 --> 34:16.560
and no temple visit.

34:16.640 --> 34:18.680
We're not truly married.

34:22.520 --> 34:24.440
- So, you don't want to marry me?
- Correct.

34:25.160 --> 34:26.480
This wasn't my wish.

34:26.560 --> 34:28.760
My elders were trying to go against me

34:28.840 --> 34:29.880
and have dragged you in.

34:30.640 --> 34:33.400
I should've discussed it with you.

34:34.000 --> 34:36.000
But since you're young and naive,

34:36.080 --> 34:37.160
I'll decide for you.

34:37.760 --> 34:39.320
The sedan is at the door.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.760
I'll send you back.

34:40.840 --> 34:42.280
In three days,

34:42.360 --> 34:44.080
my father and I will apologize in person.

34:44.160 --> 34:46.200
He'll compensate you generously.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.120
Don't agree to less.

34:47.960 --> 34:51.240
The Shen family
owns 200 acres near the capital.

34:51.320 --> 34:53.440
They yield 600 bushels of grain yearly.

34:53.520 --> 34:56.120
There are two estates in Luoyang

34:56.200 --> 34:57.640
worth 3,000 strings of cash.

34:57.720 --> 34:59.040
Demand those two.

34:59.640 --> 35:02.360
If he refuses, threaten to sue for fraud.

35:03.080 --> 35:04.960
He tricked you first.

35:05.040 --> 35:08.280
So, he must say yes
for the sake of family's reputation.

35:08.360 --> 35:09.760
Li Haode.

35:10.640 --> 35:12.120
Rushed marriages don't end well.

35:12.720 --> 35:15.440
When you marry again, look carefully.

35:16.360 --> 35:18.680
Don't let the matchmaker deceive you.

35:18.760 --> 35:23.480
When you find someone at your age
and suitable for you,

35:23.560 --> 35:25.160
I'll explain everything myself.

35:25.880 --> 35:28.320
I won't let you miss another good match.

36:18.840 --> 36:20.480
Was she safely returned to her home?

36:20.560 --> 36:23.320
- Master, something's happened.
- What?

36:23.960 --> 36:26.200
I was ready to send her back
as your ordered,

36:26.280 --> 36:28.560
but when the sedan arrived, she was gone.

36:31.480 --> 36:34.120
Who's that knocking like this?

36:34.200 --> 36:36.640
Did Chunlai oversleep again?

36:36.720 --> 36:38.160
Sleeping so soundly.

36:38.240 --> 36:39.560
- Coming, coming.
- Mom.

36:41.000 --> 36:42.000
I'll open the door.

36:45.320 --> 36:46.280
Coming.

36:48.080 --> 36:49.920
- Who is it?
- Who's there?

36:52.360 --> 36:54.640
- Haode?
- Qiongnu.

36:54.720 --> 36:55.560
Haode?

36:57.480 --> 36:58.320
Mom.

37:01.680 --> 37:03.000
Mom.

37:04.640 --> 37:05.920
Mom.

37:06.000 --> 37:07.520
What's going on?

37:08.800 --> 37:09.680
Why are you alone?

37:11.600 --> 37:13.040
Why are you shaking?

37:14.400 --> 37:15.240
Alright, alright.

37:17.000 --> 37:18.400
Put this on.

37:19.040 --> 37:20.400
Let's talk inside.

37:20.480 --> 37:21.440
Come on. Inside.

37:22.600 --> 37:23.640
Haode.

37:23.720 --> 37:24.680
Let's go.

37:30.520 --> 37:31.720
Be careful.

37:39.360 --> 37:42.000
I won't ride in their sedan.

37:42.080 --> 37:44.200
I ran off while they weren't looking.

37:46.040 --> 37:47.800
Look. Look at this.

37:47.880 --> 37:49.040
When it was arranged,

37:49.120 --> 37:50.720
I suspected something was off,

37:50.800 --> 37:51.760
but no one listened.

37:52.400 --> 37:53.480
You think it's perfect,

37:53.560 --> 37:55.920
letting the Shen family rush the wedding.

37:56.000 --> 37:57.720
They quickly married Haode off.

37:57.800 --> 38:00.480
They assumed our family wouldn't protest

38:00.560 --> 38:01.920
even if we knew the truth.

38:02.520 --> 38:04.120
This is too much.

38:04.840 --> 38:06.720
The Shen family seems well-respected.

38:06.800 --> 38:08.440
Shen Huizhao's reputation is good.

38:08.520 --> 38:09.760
He even helped us last time.

38:09.840 --> 38:14.360
I thought he chose Haode
because of that day in court.

38:15.600 --> 38:16.440
I was careless.

38:17.400 --> 38:18.240
What did Mom say?

38:19.040 --> 38:20.800
Last night, after knowing the truth,

38:20.880 --> 38:22.520
she wanted to confront them,

38:22.600 --> 38:23.760
but I stopped her.

38:24.760 --> 38:26.080
She was too angry,

38:26.720 --> 38:29.160
complaining about a headache.

38:29.240 --> 38:30.800
Qiongnu's with her inside.

38:30.880 --> 38:35.280
Mr. Shen might have some hidden illness?

38:35.360 --> 38:38.720
A man of his age should be married.

38:39.320 --> 38:41.880
They're all from prestigious families.

38:41.960 --> 38:44.400
Even if the engagement was broken,
they'd keep it quiet.

38:45.040 --> 38:46.400
They hid it well.

38:46.480 --> 38:48.200
We can't keep looking into this.

38:49.360 --> 38:50.400
Haode…

38:50.480 --> 38:51.880
Don't worry about him.

38:51.960 --> 38:53.120
It's their fault.

38:53.200 --> 38:55.120
He shouldn't be let off so easily.

38:55.200 --> 38:56.840
When he comes, strip him of everything.

38:57.440 --> 38:59.640
Take the land and property they offer.

39:00.240 --> 39:01.840
With a good dowry and land,

39:01.920 --> 39:03.440
Haode won't lack a good match.

39:04.040 --> 39:04.920
Haode,

39:05.600 --> 39:08.040
you said that Mr. Shen,

39:08.120 --> 39:09.240
though cold,

39:09.320 --> 39:12.280
is a gentleman.

39:12.360 --> 39:13.640
If we take the land

39:13.720 --> 39:16.360
and cut all ties with him,
what do you think?

39:27.200 --> 39:28.960
The Shen family

39:29.040 --> 39:31.080
is not someone we can afford.

39:31.640 --> 39:36.320
It's fine if you're just
daydreaming about it yourself.

39:36.400 --> 39:39.960
But if we really let a matchmaker
go to their house,

39:40.040 --> 39:43.360
you'll make us the laughingstock.

39:43.440 --> 39:45.680
Yes, this wasn't my wish.

41:03.880 --> 41:05.600
- Qingshi.
- Master?

41:05.680 --> 41:06.640
Get a sedan chair.

41:07.400 --> 41:09.400
- Send her back.
- Sure.

41:10.880 --> 41:12.320
Growing up,

41:13.480 --> 41:16.080
I wasn't as talented as Shouhua

41:16.800 --> 41:19.200
or as beautiful and decisive as Fuhui.

41:20.080 --> 41:23.600
I wasn't as smart
or good with words like Kangning.

41:24.640 --> 41:27.880
Even Leshan's is more lovable than me.

41:28.920 --> 41:31.800
But this is the first time
I've been humiliated.

41:32.400 --> 41:36.160
If I give up now,
I'd never forgive myself.

41:37.320 --> 41:38.560
Who compares their weaknesses

41:38.640 --> 41:41.120
to someone else's strengths?

41:41.720 --> 41:42.680
If you want to compare,

41:42.760 --> 41:44.960
Leshan wouldn't dare go to court with Mom.

41:46.400 --> 41:48.720
Oh, my dear Haode.

41:48.800 --> 41:50.920
Seems you really care for him.

41:51.640 --> 41:54.880
You never compliment me like this.

41:55.600 --> 41:56.520
Leshan.

41:58.720 --> 42:00.320
You're being foolish.

42:00.400 --> 42:03.240
Keep making mistakes
and it'll be stubbornness.

42:03.320 --> 42:05.320
A young girl's youth mustn't be wasted.

42:06.840 --> 42:10.360
Haode's so charming and sweet and honest.

42:10.440 --> 42:12.120
No one sees her coming.

42:12.200 --> 42:14.560
Shen Huizhao rejected three marriages.

42:14.640 --> 42:17.320
He can't always use land
to make up for it.

42:19.320 --> 42:20.520
Silly sister,

42:21.240 --> 42:23.240
you've got a face that can't lie,

42:23.840 --> 42:26.000
and when you cry, it's so cute.

42:26.600 --> 42:27.920
Is that your strength?

42:28.920 --> 42:31.640
Are you praising me?

42:33.920 --> 42:35.400
If you really care for him,

42:36.120 --> 42:38.080
let's figure out how to get him.

42:38.680 --> 42:41.160
The daughters of the Li family
succeed in business,

42:41.240 --> 42:43.520
win lawsuits, and even charm men.

42:44.160 --> 42:46.120
Show him the same courage
you have in court.

42:46.200 --> 42:48.360
Don't let him think he can do anything.

42:48.440 --> 42:51.040
If he falls into your hands,
he'll have to obey you.

42:52.560 --> 42:54.800
With Haode,

42:56.280 --> 42:57.440
I don't think so.

42:58.720 --> 43:00.080
Haode, how about this?

43:00.760 --> 43:01.800
Let's do a bet.

43:02.400 --> 43:04.880
If you can't tame him,

43:04.960 --> 43:06.640
I'll take one of the lands you win.

43:07.280 --> 43:09.440
You'll be my little sister from now on.

43:10.040 --> 43:12.400
I've always been the youngest.

43:12.480 --> 43:14.360
I'll get to play the big sister role.

43:15.040 --> 43:16.320
Dream on.

43:16.960 --> 43:18.000
Just watch me.

43:19.040 --> 43:20.640
I'll get it done.

43:20.720 --> 43:22.000
Trust me.

43:22.600 --> 43:24.600
Just follow your heart.

43:27.200 --> 43:30.240
You all love causing trouble.

43:32.040 --> 43:35.160
SHEN MANSION

43:35.800 --> 43:38.400
Mom, you look well today.

43:38.480 --> 43:40.520
What did I tell you?

43:41.280 --> 43:43.440
Even if he tries to avoid it,

43:44.400 --> 43:46.600
once the bride enters,

43:46.680 --> 43:48.560
they'll be a perfect couple.

43:49.320 --> 43:51.400
In a year or two,

43:52.200 --> 43:55.680
I'll have a great-grandchild.

43:57.080 --> 43:57.960
Master.

43:59.440 --> 44:02.200
The old lady's waiting for tea ritual.

44:02.280 --> 44:03.440
She's up at dawn.

44:06.880 --> 44:07.840
Mom.

44:07.920 --> 44:09.480
The bride's from a humble family,

44:09.560 --> 44:11.960
so her manners might not be perfect.

44:12.040 --> 44:14.280
I think we should
let Liu teach her some more first.

44:14.360 --> 44:15.560
Then she can greet you here.

44:15.640 --> 44:17.640
There's no one else here.

44:17.720 --> 44:19.640
No need for formalities.

44:20.920 --> 44:22.440
Right, right.

44:22.520 --> 44:25.120
Old Lady, Master, young master's here.

44:37.040 --> 44:38.120
Granny.

44:39.000 --> 44:39.920
Father.

44:40.520 --> 44:42.920
Why are you alone?

44:43.000 --> 44:44.400
Aren't you going

44:44.480 --> 44:46.840
to call the bride
to greet your grandmother?

44:47.440 --> 44:48.680
I'm not un-filial.

44:48.760 --> 44:50.000
I didn't want to upset you.

44:50.080 --> 44:51.840
I've already set my vow.

44:51.920 --> 44:54.400
I can't eat my words and waste her time.

44:54.480 --> 44:57.920
Last night,
I already told her and sent her home.

44:59.240 --> 45:01.480
Please forgive me for reporting late.

45:02.680 --> 45:03.720
You…

45:04.240 --> 45:05.520
- Old lady.
- Mom.

45:05.600 --> 45:06.520
- Old lady.
- Granny.

45:07.520 --> 45:08.360
Mom.

45:09.160 --> 45:11.520
You didn't even try to cover up.

45:12.160 --> 45:13.840
Sending her back mid-way,

45:13.920 --> 45:15.320
you've gone too far.

45:15.400 --> 45:17.120
Long life to you, Granny.

45:17.200 --> 45:18.840
I've come to greet you.

45:24.800 --> 45:26.200
Dad, long life.

45:27.560 --> 45:28.520
Husband.

45:31.200 --> 45:32.120
You…

45:32.720 --> 45:34.960
Didn't you go home?

45:35.040 --> 45:37.080
I didn't inform Granny and Dad beforehand.

45:37.680 --> 45:38.960
Even with my husband's orders,

45:39.040 --> 45:40.600
I can't act on my own.

45:40.680 --> 45:43.240
Good child, come here.

45:49.000 --> 45:50.840
Bright eyes,

45:51.600 --> 45:52.720
graceful features,

45:53.480 --> 45:56.360
full forehead, rounded chin.

45:56.440 --> 45:58.760
You can't help but like her.

45:58.840 --> 46:00.240
Granny, about this--

46:00.320 --> 46:04.000
Sending Haode away means sending my life.

46:06.600 --> 46:08.760
Don't talk about medicine.

46:08.840 --> 46:12.280
Even dragon meat from the sky won't help.

46:13.280 --> 46:15.880
If you dare speak against me,

46:15.960 --> 46:17.800
you'll be disowned.

46:17.880 --> 46:20.160
You won't be a part of the Shen family.

46:21.200 --> 46:22.040
Don't worry.

46:22.120 --> 46:23.880
As long as I'm alive,

46:23.960 --> 46:26.920
no one will dare chase you away.

46:29.000 --> 46:29.840
Sure.

46:33.920 --> 46:36.720
Li Haode, what do you want?

46:37.520 --> 46:40.720
Leaving on the wedding day,
people will blame me.

46:40.800 --> 46:42.120
I can't take this insult.

46:43.200 --> 46:45.160
You can treat me as a wife,

46:45.240 --> 46:46.840
living with you day by day.

46:46.920 --> 46:49.880
If I can change your heart,

46:49.960 --> 46:51.360
we'll be a good couple.

46:51.440 --> 46:55.600
If not, will you stay with us forever?

46:57.400 --> 47:00.160
- Let's set a deadline. Three years.
- One year.

47:00.760 --> 47:02.360
Just one year.

47:02.440 --> 47:03.600
At that time,

47:03.680 --> 47:05.800
I'll prepare dowry for you
to marry someone else.

47:05.880 --> 47:07.120
You must keep your promise.

47:07.200 --> 47:08.560
You can't change your mind.

47:08.640 --> 47:09.720
- Two years.
- Six months.

47:09.800 --> 47:10.640
- Eighteen.
- Three.

47:10.720 --> 47:12.920
Okay, fine. One year. Thank you.

47:18.200 --> 47:20.480
I don't believe I can't win you over.

47:20.560 --> 47:22.600
Let's see how long your pride lasts.

47:25.080 --> 47:25.920
Mrs. Shen.

47:26.000 --> 47:27.240
Master's busy this month.

47:27.320 --> 47:29.600
He'll be staying in the study.

47:29.680 --> 47:31.040
I was told to pack up.

47:31.680 --> 47:33.520
I don't want to delay his work.

47:33.600 --> 47:34.480
Go ahead.

47:51.040 --> 47:53.440
No need to trouble you. Let me do it.

47:53.520 --> 47:54.520
It's no trouble at all.

48:08.880 --> 48:09.760
Thank you, my lady.

48:17.560 --> 48:18.560
Look at this.

48:18.640 --> 48:20.240
It's like he's guarding against me.

48:20.320 --> 48:22.320
He won't even step inside the room.

48:22.400 --> 48:23.680
As if I'll eat him alive.

48:29.760 --> 48:31.800
I told you not to come, yet you insisted.

48:34.240 --> 48:36.440
It's not that. Mom's worried
their family's powerful,

48:36.520 --> 48:38.080
that you might be mistreated.

48:38.840 --> 48:40.560
I'm here to help you gain strength.

48:41.680 --> 48:42.920
Don't worry.

48:43.000 --> 48:45.120
The Shen family doesn't know me,

48:45.200 --> 48:46.120
so don't be afraid.

48:46.200 --> 48:49.920
Just don't cause trouble,
then I'll be grateful.

48:50.800 --> 48:53.400
You can stay here,
but do not cause trouble.

48:54.880 --> 48:57.520
The Shen family has strict rules,
lots of customs.

48:57.600 --> 48:58.880
If I didn't come,

48:58.960 --> 49:01.400
your efforts might have been in vain.

49:03.760 --> 49:05.360
I've gathered some useful info

49:05.440 --> 49:06.840
because of my little tricks.

49:07.880 --> 49:09.920
The Shen family has four branches,

49:10.000 --> 49:12.320
but the eldest is the legitimate heir.

49:12.960 --> 49:15.880
The others live separately.

49:16.600 --> 49:20.040
The eldest has one son,
your troublesome husband.

49:21.560 --> 49:24.120
His two older brothers passed away,

49:24.720 --> 49:26.120
and his granny had no choice

49:26.200 --> 49:28.680
but to follow the old custom,
sending him to the temple.

49:31.440 --> 49:32.520
I see.

49:32.600 --> 49:33.440
Exactly.

49:33.520 --> 49:36.040
The eldest branch has no heirs,

49:36.560 --> 49:38.640
so who will inherit the Shen family?

49:39.440 --> 49:41.680
It must be troubling for the old lady.

49:41.760 --> 49:42.640
If it were me,

49:43.280 --> 49:45.320
I'd lose sleep too.

49:49.720 --> 49:51.160
What's the plan moving forward?

49:52.560 --> 49:54.200
The Li family's teachings are clear.

49:54.280 --> 49:59.080
We must focus and act when the time comes.

49:59.160 --> 50:01.520
I watch my sisters closely.

50:01.600 --> 50:04.120
I'll follow their example,
even if just a bit.

50:05.720 --> 50:08.160
When did our family have such teachings?

50:08.840 --> 50:10.880
Mom always said,

50:10.960 --> 50:12.800
if you see something good, take it.

50:13.800 --> 50:16.560
Don't let others get it first.

50:19.080 --> 50:23.680
We used to sleep in the same bed
and still do.

50:23.760 --> 50:25.520
We are close enemies, aren't we?

50:28.640 --> 50:29.720
Let's sleep.

53:01.960 --> 53:04.360
Subtitle translation by: Yi Yang
